    "  giphyRatedPg  - rating 'pg'. The adapter normalizes it; catalog.js drops",
    "                  it. This is the fixture that proves layer 2 runs.",
    "  giphyUnrated  - no rating field at all -> 'unrated' -> also dropped.",
    "  giphyEvilUrl  - images.fixed_height.url points at an attacker host. The",
    "                  asset's own url must STILL be the pinned media.giphy.com",
    "                  template, because it is derived and never copied.",
    "  giphyBadId    - an id containing a path separator; must be dropped",
    "                  entirely rather than producing an escaping URL.",
    "  giphyNoTitle  - empty title -> the 'GIF' fallback, never an empty label."
